{"synopsis":"\"Tunggu dulu, kenapa badanku jadi pendek dan bulat begini?!!\" Kematian seharusnya menjadi akhir dari kehidupan, apalagi bagi seekor Imoogi berusia 999 tahun yang tewas dibunuh hanya satu tahun sebelum ia berhasil berevolusi menjadi naga. Namun, takdir berkata lain. Ia justru terbangun kembali sebagai anakan naga berusia satu tahun yang menggemaskan, tentunya dengan ingatan masa lalu yang masih utuh! Di kehidupan keduanya ini, ia merasakan sesuatu yang tidak pernah ia dapatkan selama 999 tahun... cinta tanpa syarat. Hatinya yang dulu dingin kini perlahan menghangat. Bersama keluarga yang menyayanginya dan teman-teman baru di sisinya,...ia siap bertualang, memperluas dunianya, dan kembali mengejar satu-satunya impian yang belum terwujud, menjadi naga sejati!","alternative_title":"어느 날 해츨링이 되었다","author":"Panthera","artist":"Ripia","chapters":[{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"5623451a-07e6-45f7-b8da-46fe80cc749b","date":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"b5381ddb-b6bd-4d90-9f15-50ffa8340641","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"number":"17","chapter":"17","slug":"4534f789-f45e-4449-ae23-ea3c97c74fe6","date":"2026-07-13","images":[]},{"number":"16","chapter":"16","slug":"2c1c6d61-518f-4156-8292-d20d524da8ef","date":"2026-07-07","images":[]},{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"c2aff6cd-fdc2-44d8-ae45-42b6eed80131","date":"2026-07-06","images":[]},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"62373ca2-00fe-4448-89d9-a79c2615d0f9","date":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"number":"13","chapter":"13","slug":"e0156da8-55ac-40eb-9236-0c84e4918132","date":"2026-06-22","images":[]},{"number":"12","chapter":"12","slug":"89b0f131-f63e-4b1d-b6bf-3b91499129a9","date":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"number":"11","chapter":"11","slug":"2afa4eba-1e80-4ba9-913e-10ef6f0b9ade","date":"2026-06-08","images":[]},{"number":"10","chapter":"10","slug":"516d40d8-79d5-41e8-81bd-c39fa937ad72","date":"2026-06-01","images":[]},{"number":"9","chapter":"9","slug":"8a1691